body:
@juanborre Yes, I think this is a key part of this proposal to decide on. We need to balance suggesting providing more than one TripUpdate, without encouraging producers to share too many TripUpdates for future trips to the point where predictions are meaningless.

The current text was an attempt to explicitly suggest providing predictions for the next trip (Trip B, which usually makes sense), without explicitly addressing additional trips - so my intent wasn't to prohibit Trips C, D etc. if they make sense in a certain context.

Do you have any suggestions for different language that strikes this balance?

